    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the privacy risks and bias stuff seem kinda vague tho. like, what are the actual big deal arguments against it? is it just people being paranoid about privacy or is there a legitimate reason to be worried about the tech itself? rivingriving deep deep deep deep deep the risks downsides, i need more than just",
